# Invariant 6: an instance proposal older than its TTL - 24 hours in a text group - is void, a
# commit MAY omit it, and when every instance proposal has gone void the freeze lifts. The instance
# proposes adding bob with one of his KeyPackages; nobody commits it for a day; alice's next commit
# leaves the void Add out and is accepted, and bob joins by a fresh KeyPackage afterwards.
instance dilla
client alice
client bob
group chat kind=text target=d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6d6 community=none creator=alice
admit chat bob
expect_425 send alice chat before the day is out
advance_clock 24h
commit alice
send alice chat the freeze has lifted
join bob chat via=welcome
send alice chat bob is in on a fresh KeyPackage
expect_decrypts bob chat bob is in on a fresh KeyPackage
